<title>UK: Pemberstone to buy property from Woolwich.</title>
<headline>Pemberstone to buy property from Woolwich.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Pemberstone Plc said on Wednesday it had agreed in principle to buy a portfolio of residential dwellings from Woolwich Building Society for about 12 million stg.</p>
<p>Most of the tenanted properties are located in southeast England.</p>
<p>Pemberstone also said it made an offer to buy the rest of South Eastern Recovery Assured Homes Plc for about 4.8 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
